# Jane Street Market Forecasting Scope

This folder is purely an offline learning example.

When working in `jane-street-market-forecasting/`:
- Do not optimize for or design around online Kaggle submission.
- Do not add online inference server, submission API, or competition deployment code unless explicitly requested.
- Prefer local experimentation, EDA, reproducible notebooks, and offline validation.
